issues.body:
**Is your feature request related to a problem? Please describe.**
I'm putty, and ttyd user, and when I selected text in terminal is been automatically copied (under windows). In the integrate ssh terminal I must right click on selection and select copy (Firefox/win10), so I always forget and crying...

**Describe the solution you'd like**
On integrate HTML ssh client, add copyOnSelection option.

**Describe alternatives you've considered**
I dont know

**Additional context**
I not js dev but I saw that for xterm:
```
const { Terminal } = require('xterm');
const { FitAddon } = require('xterm-addon-fit');

// Create a new terminal
const terminal = new Terminal({
  copyOnSelection: true, // Enable copy on selection
});

// Load the FitAddon for responsive sizing
const fitAddon = new FitAddon();
terminal.loadAddon(fitAddon);

// Open the terminal in a DOM element
terminal.open(document.getElementById('terminal'));

// Fit the terminal to its container
fitAddon.fit();
```
